Synthesis:
As of August 29, 2026, Tokyo is experiencing cool, unsettled weather due to a stationary autumnal rain front [1]. Conditions are predominantly cloudy with intermittent rain [2][1][3]. The temperature is significantly lower than average for late August, with recent readings around 20-21°C (68-70°F) [4][5][1]. High temperatures for the day reached approximately 22-26°C [2][1]. Humidity levels remain high, frequently exceeding 85-95% [4][6][7][2]. Current wind is light, primarily originating from northerly or northeasterly directions [4][5][1]. Unstable atmospheric conditions are expected to persist through the weekend [8].

